<title>USA: Aiken Cty CSD, S.C., won by Wachovia Bank.</title>
<headline>Aiken Cty CSD, S.C., won by Wachovia Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wachovia Bank said it won $9.600 million of Aiken Cty CSD, S.C., school building bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.90 percent.</p>
</text>
